  "source_logic_observations": [
    "src/server.ts and src/mcp/tools/index.ts register universal info/action discovery plus flat, gateway, or exclusive Code Mode surfaces.",
    "src/context/engine.ts combines retrieval lanes, graph beam expansion, task profiles, budgeted selection, and selected-only hydration; graph unavailability returns structured recovery actions.",
    "src/mcp/tools/context.ts applies canonicalization, ETag conditional responses, session refs, packed-wire gating, raw-equivalent estimation, and large-response artifact handling.",
    "src/mcp/token-usage.ts compares serialized SDL response tokens with raw-equivalent file-byte estimates; this is internal modeled savings, not provider-billed accounting.",
    "src/mcp/response-compression.ts stores large responses as same-session artifacts and records estimated avoided tokens; inline responses are explicitly recorded as missed opportunities for auto mode.",
    "src/mcp/session-dedupe.ts bounds session ledgers by TTL, session count, and entries per session.",
    "src/cli/commands/init.ts supports client-specific setup, enforcement assets, optional Codex skill installation, runtime limits, and repo indexing.",
    "scripts/postinstall.mjs runs tree-sitter, Watchman, pruning, and embedding-model setup as best-effort lifecycle steps; scripts/postinstall-models.mjs downloads pinned ONNX artifacts with size and SHA-256 checks.",
    "sdlbench enforces claim grades, paired pass-gated deltas, tiktoken/session usage accounting, and fairness deductions, but the checked-in OpenCode sample remains secondary evidence."
  ],
